{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11105240","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11105240","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1110524001:1":{"text":"早く診てやってくれ……頼む。","source_cn":"快些检查吧……拜托了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x118461DF697A5842","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1110524002:1":{"text":"うーん……アルサはんの症状とナイフに残った毒の色を見るに……","source_cn":"唔……从阿尔萨的症状和匕首上残余毒药的色泽判断——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x69846B180376688F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1110524003:1":{"text":"おそらくあの毒で間違いあらへんなぁ……","source_cn":"错不了，确实是我想的那种毒药。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD6C4B76D8A5067BB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1110524004:1":{"text":"ちょっと！もったいぶらないでよ！いいから解毒剤を作れるかどうか教えなさい！","source_cn":"喂！你在将功补过，别卖关子了！你能配出解药吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE92EE7E2B88025EC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1110524005:1":{"text":"できると言えばできるし、できないと言えばできまへんなぁ……","source_cn":"能，也不能。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3A7282105A540092","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:7:1110524005":{"text":"できると言えばできるし、できないと言えばできまへんなぁ……","source_cn":"能，也不能。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3A7282105A540092","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1110524006:1":{"text":"ひぃっ！そんなおっかない目で睨まんといて！ちゃあんと説明するさかい……","source_cn":"呃！你们的眼神不要这么恐怖！是这样的……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFD134460D09CABEE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1110524007:1":{"text":"解毒剤のレシピに心当たりはあるんやが、肝心の薬草が一つ足りひんのや。","source_cn":"解药的配方我大致有头绪，不过缺少了一种关键的草药！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0A5FC899A5FB3739","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1110524008:1":{"text":"曜砂草（ようしゃそう）っちゅう薬草でな、手に入れる方法は一つだけ……なんやと思う？","source_cn":"那种草药叫曜砂草，只有一个渠道能搞到，你们猜猜是哪里——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9576091877B54585","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:11:1110524008":{"text":"曜砂草（ようしゃそう）っちゅう薬草でな、手に入れる方法は一つだけ……なんやと思う？","source_cn":"那种草药叫曜砂草，只有一个渠道能搞到，你们猜猜是哪里——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9576091877B54585","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1110524009:1":{"text":"わ、わざとやないんや！子どもたちに物語を読み聞かせる時の癖でつい……","source_cn":"我、我真的不是有意的！唉，都是给孩子们讲太多睡前故事，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC2DC4D36708206AA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1110524010:1":{"text":"薬草商人のバンジっちゅうもんがその薬草を売っとるはずやけど、普段は残陽の武闘場におるんや。","source_cn":"我只认识一个草药商——班吉能提供这种草药，他平时在残阳...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC953FA149DC45FD4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1110524011:1":{"text":"ここから武闘場へ？来たときのように、ブラックロアーの縄張りから迂回してたら間に合わないぞ……","source_cn":"从战歌营帐去残阳武斗场？如果像来的时候那样从黑嚎营地绕...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5F8449FE7225F55C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1110524012:1":{"text":"いいえ、迂回する必要はないわ、ソーン。今は一秒も無駄にできない……","source_cn":"人命关天，片刻都不能耽误。不必绕路了，索恩……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4BCD2F333F1F47FB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1110524013:0":{"text":"武闘場の裏口から入れるよう、あたしが通行書を用意してあげる！","source_cn":"我会给你们一份手书，让你们可以从武斗场的后门通过！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDC49486FBFD7D80A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:17::0":{"text":"通行許可証","source_cn":"通行证","status":"matched","hash_xx